microbial systems</article-title><source>Annu Rev Genet</source><year>1973</year><volume>7</volume><fpage>267</fpage><lpage>287</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4593305</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1146/annurev.ge.07.120173.001411</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frydman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Folding of newly translated proteins <italic>in vivo</italic>: the role of molecular chaperones</article-title><source>Annu Rev Biochem</source><year>2001</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>603</fpage><lpage>647</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11395418</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1146/annurev.biochem.70.1.603</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Conti</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Franks</surname><given-names>NP</given-names></name><name><surname>Brick</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Crystal structure of firefly luciferase throws light on a superfamily of adenylate-forming enzymes</article-title><source>Structure</source><year>1996</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>287</fpage><lpage>298</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8805533</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0969-2126(96)00033-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hino</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kataoka</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kajimoto</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamamoto</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kido</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Shinohara</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Baba</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><